"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alison Rose","x":"Katie, do you want to pick up the question on the rate pass-through in mortgages?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2021 Q3","e":"nwg","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"That's down 13 million pounds on the third quarter last year and reflects ongoing cost reduction, partly offset by higher investment spend as expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2021 Q3","e":"nwg","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"This takes our year-to-date cost savings to 4.3% and we continue to expect to deliver savings of around 4% for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q1","e":"nwg","d":"2022-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"There has been quite limited pass through in Q1, which has helped us kind of improve this guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/30/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q1","e":"nwg","d":"2022-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"However, I would say of the last deposit rate change that we saw -- we did in April was equivalent to 40% pass through there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/30/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q1","e":"nwg","d":"2022-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"Operating expenses fell 22% to 1.7 billion, driven by the absence of the annual UK bank levy, lower conduct costs, and of course ongoing cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/30/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q1","e":"nwg","d":"2022-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"We are delivering on our income growth, cost reduction, and capital targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/30/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alison Rose","x":"We also have a well-established ecosystem for small and medium businesses with sector specialists and business hubs around the U.K. We are monitoring our customers carefully to identify early dose, who are having difficulties and have frozen any increase in tariffs for our smaller customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alison Rose","x":"We're freezing tariffs on our business current accounts for 12 months to help SMEs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"Using an illustrative 50% pass-through, this would add a further GBP 0.2 billion of managed margin benefit this year with the full run rate benefit flowing through in 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"Clearly, the actual benefit depends on the timing and size of rate increases, changes in deposit balances and pass-through decisions but this is how I am currently thinking about the potential impact of higher interest rates on our 2022 income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"This cost reduction, combined with the improvements in income has supported a nine percentage point improvement in the cost-to-income ratio to 55% in the half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"We are protecting our investments spend and remain committed to delivering the same gross cost savings in the plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"And we reaffirm our guidance on capital.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2022 Q2","e":"nwg","d":"2022-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Katie Murray","x":"So what we've done in 2023 is to maintain guidance we've given you previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/31/natwest-group-plc-nwg-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"NWG 2025 Q3","e":"nwg","d":"2025-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Thwaite","x":"I guess, we talked at the half year around the kind of ISA season and some of the -- get the confluence of debate around the future of ISA and how that led and some of the movements in the swap curves on the back of tariffs and how that led to different pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/24/natwest-nwg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NWG 2025 Q3","e":"nwg","d":"2025-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Thwaite","x":"And it's not only cost out it's also improving customer experience and colleague experience as well."